# "Whenever you tap a land for {C}, add an additional {C}" (CR 605.1b, 106.12a) is a triggered mana ability: it resolves at once,
# without the stack, and only for a land tapped for {C}. Wastes gives {C}{C}; Sol Ring (not a land) gives its {C}{C} undoubled.
# Mox Ruby pays for Sol Ring; Black Lotus and Sol Ring pay for Ultima on turn 1 (a tapped Mountain gives an undoubled {R}: see the first Ultima scenario).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Ultima, Origin of Oblivion
Wastes
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ultima, Origin of Oblivion.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Wastes.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Wastes.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}{C}
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}{C}{C}{C}
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Mana = {C}{C}{C}{C}
